    # ---- B2, the 2026-10-19 review: the index-pair chart against the gold chart; the gap's mean reversion; how long gold stays positive after a break
    H.append("<p><b>Is there a relationship between the index-pair chart (top panel) and the gold-vs-each-index chart (middle panel)?</b> — the question of how such a relationship could be established at all.</p>")
